{"entries":[{"id":"simonwillison-battledrones","sourceId":"simonwillison","sourceName":"西蒙·威利森 · Simon Willison's Weblog","title":"Battle Drones—a vibe coded RTS with audio-based multiplayer","titleZh":"战斗无人机——一款由氛围编程打造、支持音频联机的即时战略游戏","published":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1792454400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/simonwillison-battledrones/","image":"","summary":"A browser-based RTS built almost entirely through vibe coding with agents like Claude Code, featuring audio-synced local multiplayer and proving coding agents can produce genuinely fun games.","summaryZh":"一款几乎完全借助 Claude Code 等编程智能体以氛围编程方式打造的浏览器即时战略游戏，支持通过音频同步的本地多人对战，证明编程智能体已能做出真正好玩的游戏。"},{"id":"simonwillison-default-hard-budget-caps","sourceId":"simonwillison","sourceName":"西蒙·威利森 · Simon Willison's Weblog","title":"We’re going to need default hard budget caps on pretty much everything","titleZh":"我们几乎需要对所有东西设置默认的硬性预算上限","published":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1790985600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/simonwillison-default-hard-budget-caps/","image":"","summary":"Pay-by-usage services and APIs urgently need default hard budget caps that cut off usage and return errors at a spending threshold, rather than soft caps that only send warnings, because AI agents can rack up runaway costs overnight.","summaryZh":"按用量付费的服务和 API 亟需默认的硬性预算上限——达到消费阈值即切断使用并返回错误，而非仅发送警告邮件的软性上限，因为 AI 智能体可能在一夜之间产生失控的高额费用。"},{"id":"simonwillison-2026-in-llms-so-far","sourceId":"simonwillison","sourceName":"西蒙·威利森 · Simon Willison's Weblog","title":"2026 in LLMs (so far)","titleZh":"2026 年大语言模型进展（迄今）","published":"2026-09-27T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1790467200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/simonwillison-2026-in-llms-so-far/","image":"","summary":"2026 was the year LLMs achieved product-market fit through coding agents, triggering personal-agent explosions, tokenmaxxing, and debates over fully automated software factories.","summaryZh":"2026 年是大语言模型通过编程智能体实现产品市场契合的一年，由此引发